# Optional. CareLoop runs with no .env at all: a scripted planner, pattern-based document reading,
# and the browser's own speech. Copy this file to .env and fill in only what you need.
# Settings are commented out on purpose: an empty value would replace a working default.
# Keep notes on their own lines; text after a value becomes part of the value.

# ---- Model standing in for Alexa+'s (voice planner and document reading) ----
# mock (scripted, the default), ollama, or openai: any OpenAI-compatible chat completions endpoint
# with tool calling. With openai, the text of a shared document is sent to that endpoint.
# CARELOOP_AGENT_LLM=
# Endpoint (your provider's /v1 URL; Ollama defaults to http://127.0.0.1:11434), a tool-calling model, and its key
# LLM_BASE_URL=
# LLM_MODEL=
# LLM_API_KEY=
# Seconds to wait for a reply (default 60)
# LLM_TIMEOUT_SECONDS=

# ---- Local voice (models download on first use) ----
# VOICE=kokoro and STT=whisper; WHISPER_MODEL defaults to small.en
# VOICE=
# STT=
# WHISPER_MODEL=

# Everything else has a working default. The full list is in docs/CARELOOP_CONFIGURATION.md.
